%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12550e90c236e0541b910f7291e37631, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueFinal
  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: "G\u2019doy matey, an\u2019 welcome t\u2019yer first day at Universal
        Parcel Service."
    - text: "Ye\u2019ll be expected t\u2019deliver packages t\u2019our customers,
        an\u2019 yer gonna do it well. Got it?"
    - text: "So, I\u2019m in charge o\u2019 onboarding an\u2019 all that. First though,
        I\u2019m gonna need ya t\u2019come t\u2019my office, \u2018kay?"
  - sentences:
    - text: "\u2018Ey mate, good t\u2019finally see ya in person."
    - text: "Now, \u2018ere\u2019s a package we need delivered soon, an\u2019 all
        our other employees are kinda busy right now, so this is yer problem."
    - text: "Go ahead an\u2019 grab it with E."
  - sentences:
    - text: "Cool, be careful with the package by the way. Wouldn\u2019t wanna mess
        up our reputation any more than it already has."
    - text: "Next I need ye t\u2019load this package onto yer ship. Pick up the package
        an\u2019 press E t\u2019get in."
    - text: "An\u2019 don\u2019t ye dare forget t\u2019put it in the ship. If y\u2019did
        yer gonna have t\u2019report it to the recipient. Got it?"
  - sentences:
    - text: "Congrats on yer first take-off. Pray it won\u2019t be yer last."
    - text: "Fer a crash course on how not t\u2019crash, move around usin\u2019 our
        patented UPS thruster technology."
    - text: "Oh, and press TAB to see the ship\u2019s log, it tells ya everything
        ya oughta know about yer deliveries."
    - text: "Right, that package I gave ya needs to go to Orbitron. That\u2019s the
        purple one in case ya live under an asteroid."
    - text: Just fly over there, the ships fancy parking systems oughta have the
        rest covered.
  - sentences:
    - text: "Talk with the fellow marked on yer minimap t\u2019leave the package
        with \u2018em. They\u2019ll pay ye fer yer service!"
  - sentences:
    - text: "Congrats on yer first official delivery! I\u2019m all outta lessons
        for ye, so now yer on yer own."
    - text: "If ye keep performin\u2019 this well, we higher-ups may have somethin\u2019
        special for ye to deliver\u2026"
    - text: Come back up 'ere an' I'll get ye off t'yer next job
    - text: "Remember, always do the right thing fer the company. Ye\u2019ll be set
        up fer success that way."
